<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ADONIS IN TALKS, CAUTIONS SHAREHOLDERS.</title>
<headline>ADONIS IN TALKS, CAUTIONS SHAREHOLDERS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Adonis Knitwear Holdings Ltd said on Friday it was in talks which could have an effect on its share price on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings until further notice.</p>
<p>The company gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
